name: Embedded Collection Event Channel
type:
  blueId: CaFMD5Tpz4LbGjJsftT3465hKBWa7Ti6dutYHnCSRQyR
description: >
  Processor-managed Channel receiving Embedded Event Delivery occurrences from
  members of one effective Process Embedded collection in the same scope. By
  default it matches only member-root source paths. When includeDescendants is
  true, it also matches nested source paths below each member. Membership is
  determined by normalized decoded Runtime Pointer segments, not raw string
  prefixes. The Channel is internal and creates no Timeline provider subscription
  or checkpoint surface.
collectionPath:
  type:
    blueId: GX7CFUmSDrE2MzptunLCCdZwnuwwrenRQqEnHL4x3uoC
  description: >
    Required normalized absolute Runtime Pointer equal to one effective Process
    Embedded collectionPaths entry in the same scope.
  schema:
    required: true
includeDescendants:
  type:
    blueId: AwvXD961fmnmqcSQhjMA7r15HpVh39cefb6ZTyUz2Fm2
  description: >
    Optional. Omitted or false matches only direct member roots; true also matches
    descendants below each direct member. The collection path itself never matches.
event:
  description: Optional exact event matcher using the ordinary embedded-event matcher semantics.
